# Work context routing

Determine which context applies before making changes:

| User intent | Context | Key paths |
|-------------|---------|-----------|
| Base product, platform features, AI chatbot, resume matching, ATS integration, admin, candidate UX | **Base product** | `frontend/src/`, `backend/src/careers/`, core API — see `base-product-development.mdc` |
| `/newcustomer`, `/iterate-customer`, prospect demo, outreach, branding extraction, white-label demo | **Prospect outreach** | `backend/src/branding/`, `docs/examples/*-branding.json`, `.cursor/commands/newcustomer.md` |
| Visual parity, production deploy for demos | **Prospect outreach** | `prospect-visual-brand-parity.mdc`, `prospect-outreach-production.mdc` |

When ambiguous, ask once: **"Are we improving the base product or customizing a prospect demo?"**

Do not run `demo-from-website` or edit prospect branding JSON during base product work. Do not refactor core product features during prospect outreach unless the user asks.
